Recognize symbolic icons in the unthemed fallback lookup.

Application icons directly under a GResource icons/ directory go through
this branch, unlike icons in a theme's scalable/actions/ directory. GTK
4.16 forgets is_symbolic here and renders the original SVG colors instead
of the widget's foreground color. This affects the sun and layout preview
icons in the AppImage. Match the detection already used by themed icons
and gtk_icon_paintable_new_for_file, without changing application resources
or other packages.

--- a/gtk/gtkicontheme.c
+++ b/gtk/gtkicontheme.c
@@ -2227,6 +2227,7 @@
             {
               icon->is_svg = suffix_from_name (icon->filename) == ICON_CACHE_FLAG_SVG_SUFFIX;
               icon->is_resource = unthemed_icon->is_resource;
+              icon->is_symbolic = icon_uri_is_symbolic (icon->filename, -1);
               goto out;
             }
         }
